  "id": "secondary-memory",
  "term": "secondary memory",
  "definition": "Secondary memory is memory proper: awareness of a past event or fact after it has already passed out of consciousness, together with the sense that it was previously experienced or thought. It is more than a repeated image in the mind, because the revived content is understood as belonging to the past.",
